# Apps published on https://xprs.dev/apps, one folder name per line.
#
# This is the curated set, not every folder in the repo: an app is listed
# here once it is worth installing. build-catalog.py turns this list into
# catalog.json, reading each app's manifest.json, store/description.json
# and store/screenshots/, and the package under binaries/. The package for
# the manifest version must be built first (./build-archive.sh <name>).
#
# One app for now, to test the page and the store that will read it.
widget_demo
